# Emrakul, the Exigent Doom's ruling: "If Emrakul is removed from exile without being cast, the land will continue to have
# this ability." Bot1 exiles Emrakul on turn 1 to give its Island "{T}: Add {C}{C}". On turn 2 Bot2's Binding Negotiation
# chooses nothing from Bot1's revealed hand and puts the face-up Emrakul from exile into Bot1's graveyard (a new object, CR
# 400.7, that can never be cast from exile as that card). On turn 3 the Island still taps for {C}{C}.

